# EtBanner Component

## Purpose & Scope

`EtBanner` is an inline, dismissible promo/info banner for the eToro design system.
It matches the DS React **Banner** variants ([Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/cMyPhFndkPeXR6UkIuZujT/DS---React?node-id=56563-58537)):

- **Title + description** (always)
- **Optional actions**: primary `EtButton` (`size="tiny"`) and/or `EtLink` (`size="small"`)
- **Optional trailing illustration** (`small` | `medium` | `large`)
- **Optional dismiss** via `onClose` (xmark, top-end)

**Does NOT handle:**

- Eligibility, Mixpanel cohorts, or once-per-user persistence (host / PMM promo layer)
- Navigation / deeplinks (wire `onPress` on button/link in the host)
- Full-screen carousels (use `EtWizard`) or modal sheets (use `EtBottomSheet`)

