## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtBanner` (root)

```tsx
<EtBanner
  onClose?: () => void
  closeAccessibilityLabel?: string  // default: 'Close'
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  testID?: string
  accessibilityLabel?: string
>
  {children}
</EtBanner>
```

### Compound children

| Slot | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `EtBanner.Title` | Label/Primary/Semibold heading |
| `EtBanner.Description` | Body/Secondary/Regular copy |
| `EtBanner.Actions` | Row for `EtButton` / `EtLink` |
| `EtBanner.Illustration` | Trailing side art (`size` preset) |

### Types

| Type | Values |
| --- | --- |
| `BannerIllustrationSize` | `'small'` \| `'medium'` \| `'large'` |
| `EtBannerChildren` | Compound child element(s) for the root `children` prop |

## Usage Patterns

### 1. Title + description + close

```tsx
<EtBanner onClose={handleClose}>
  <EtBanner.Title>Title</EtBanner.Title>
  <EtBanner.Description>
    Apple Inc. is a technology company that engages in the design, manufacturing, and marketing of.
  </EtBanner.Description>
</EtBanner>
```

### 2. With text link

```tsx
<EtBanner onClose={handleClose}>
  <EtBanner.Title>Title</EtBanner.Title>
  <EtBanner.Description>Supporting copy.</EtBanner.Description>
  <EtBanner.Actions>
    <EtLink size="small" onPress={onLearnMore}>
      <EtLink.Label>Label</EtLink.Label>
      <EtLink.Icon name="chevronRight" />
    </EtLink>
  </EtBanner.Actions>
</EtBanner>
```

### 3. With button + illustration

```tsx
<EtBanner onClose={handleClose}>
  <EtBanner.Title>Title</EtBanner.Title>
  <EtBanner.Description>Supporting copy.</EtBanner.Description>
  <EtBanner.Actions>
    <EtButton size="tiny" variant="primary-filled" onPress={onCta}>
      Label
    </EtButton>
  </EtBanner.Actions>
  <EtBanner.Illustration size="large">
    <Image source={art} style={{ width: 112, height: 144 }} />
  </EtBanner.Illustration>
</EtBanner>
```

Illustration **requires children** for production art. Without children the slot renders nothing (no dashed preview chrome in the kit).

### 4. Button + link together

```tsx
<EtBanner.Actions>
  <EtButton size="tiny" variant="primary-filled" onPress={onCta}>
    Label
  </EtButton>
  <EtLink size="small" onPress={onSecondary}>
    <EtLink.Label>Label</EtLink.Label>
    <EtLink.Icon name="chevronRight" />
  </EtLink>
</EtBanner.Actions>
```

## Design Tokens

| Token | Usage |
| --- | --- |
| `colors.cardDefault` | Banner background |
| `colors.textPrimaryNeutral` | Title, description, close icon |
| `X4` | Content padding, border radius |
| `X3` | Gap content↔illustration, description↔actions, close inset |
| `X1` | Gap title↔body |

Reuse kit primitives — do **not** restyle button/link inside the banner:

- Button: `EtButton` `variant="primary-filled"` `size="tiny"` (32px, matches Figma Label button S)
- Link: `EtLink` `size="small"` with trailing `chevronRight`

## Notes for Agents

- Margins are **not** baked in — host screens pass `style` for spacing.
- Slot detection uses compound `displayName` (same pattern as most kit compounds).
- When `onClose` is set, content reserves trailing space so title/body never sit under the X.
- Illustration without children renders `null` — Storybook may pass its own dashed preview child.
- For PMM in-app promos, wrap with failsafe gating per `.cursor/skills/domains/pmm-in-app-promos/SKILL.md`.
- Import: `import { EtBanner, EtButton, EtLink } from 'etoro-ui'` — never `@etoro/etoro-ui`.

## Anti-Patterns

❌ Hardcoded hex colors instead of `useEtoroTheme`  
❌ Pixel paddings instead of `X*` spacing tokens  
❌ Putting business eligibility inside the kit component  
❌ Using `EtButton` `size="small"` when matching Figma Banner (use `tiny`)  
❌ Shipping dashed illustration placeholders in the kit (keep preview chrome in Storybook)  
❌ Overriding `label-primary-semibold` line-height — use the typography token as-is
